Salat Desk: third-party content and components

Quran
  Arabic text: Tanzil.net, Uthmani script (https://tanzil.net), via AlQuran.cloud
  (https://alquran.cloud). Used unaltered, with attribution, as their terms require.
  English translation: Sahih International, via AlQuran.cloud.
  The starter set in src/DeskDashboard.Core/Content/seed-content.json and the text the app
  downloads weekly come from https://api.alquran.cloud.

Hadith
  Arabic and English text: fawazahmed0/hadith-api (https://github.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api),
  released under the Unlicense, served by jsDelivr. Collections used: Sahih al-Bukhari,
  Sahih Muslim, An-Nawawi's Forty Hadith, Forty Hadith Qudsi.

Prayer time calculation
  NuGet package "Adhan" 0.9.0 (https://github.com/stankovski/adhan-csharp), a .NET port of the
  Adhan prayer-times library by Batoul Apps. See its repository for its license terms.

City search
  Open-Meteo Geocoding API (https://open-meteo.com), CC BY 4.0.

Calculated prayer times are astronomical estimates, not a religious authority. Verify them
against your local mosque.
